2491: of the 2490 numbers 2491 + 2^m, 2408 have a prime factor below 2,000 and the other 82 fail a Fermat test to base 3
4471: of the 4470 numbers 4471 + 2^m, 4339 have a prime factor below 2,000 and the other 131 fail a Fermat test to base 3
